      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to $\\frac{10-8a}{5}?$",
      "worked_solution": "Splitting the fraction into separate terms and then simplifying the fractions in individual terms, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{10-8a}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{10}{5}-\\frac{8a}{5} & = \\\\ 2-\\frac{8a}{5} & .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
